WEBVTT

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.240
DRIFT

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:54.690
<i>Today's guest is</i>
<i>everyone's favorite, Robin!</i>

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:56.230
Aren't they...

00:00:57.270 --> 00:00:58.480
Aren't they adorable?

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:01.820
Yeah... Sure...

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:04.740
It just meowed, sir!

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:07.110
Yup. It sure did.

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:12.410
Sir! Look at them!
They're rolling around again!

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:15.120
Yup, they're rolling around.

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:19.580
They're so cute,
I can't even swallow my food!

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:28.010
Sir, I've made a decision.
I'm going to get a cat!

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:31.600
You're okay with that, right?

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:32.970
-Denied.
-What?

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:35.890
Why not?

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:37.060
I hate cats.

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:42.230
No, I can't believe it! They're so cute!

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:46.070
If you hate cats, you must be a monster
or something, sir!

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:50.910
People are able to get through tough jobs
by watching adorable cat videos!

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:53.120
-It's a scheme.
-What?

00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:58.710
Some powerful person must be leaking
cat videos periodically to manipulate us.

00:01:58.790 --> 00:01:59.630
What?

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:03.050
By making people believe
they're getting soothed by cat videos,

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:05.460
they get stripped of their belligerence

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:10.680
so they'll keep working hard
without questioning those in power.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:15.470
But sir, it's not good to lie.

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:16.390
What?

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:20.270
Sir, you wear these badges all the time.

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:22.730
These are cats--

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:26.990
Cat-like things... Right?

00:02:27.490 --> 00:02:30.070
Exactly. They're not cats.

00:02:30.530 --> 00:02:34.410
Zero, I'm just not into the idea
of owning animals.

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:36.620
Then, what's this?

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:38.660
We can't have cats.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:44.590
I understand.

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:46.760
Sorry.

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:48.670
No, it's okay.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:55.720
So by the way, what are these badges?

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:00.520
Are they important to you?

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:15.120
I suppose.

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:52.670
EYE OF SHUIN

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:54.720
In!

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:59.680
Talk to me! You do hear me, right?

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:02.970
What the heck are you
thinking about anyway?

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:05.480
-Family.
-What?

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:09.690
I was contemplating about family.

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:16.910
You... had a family?

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:19.490
Where are they and what do they do?

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:21.030
I don't know.

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:23.290
They're not with us anymore.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:28.080
I... wasn't able to protect them.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:31.000
Why? Was it because you were weak, In?

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:34.170
I was the strongest of them all.

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:36.260
Not enough effort?

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:40.050
I probably put in the most effort.

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:42.350
Then why?

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:48.020
Because...

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:52.520
I was the most foolish of them all.

00:05:54.110 --> 00:05:56.860
Yo, be an intelligent person.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:09.830
Yo.

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:13.750
I'll do it.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:34.070
I wanna be useful to you, In!

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:39.490
See? I can even Lacht a knife!

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:40.780
Not good enough.

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:42.950
Why?

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:44.830
-You're not ready yet.
-What?

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:06.310
<i>Jeez, he still treats me like a kid.</i>

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:08.560
<i>I'm a fully-fledged--</i>

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:20.400
<i>An adventurer.</i>

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:24.370
<i>Looks like their attempt</i>
<i>to hunt the monster went awry.</i>

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:41.680
It's okay. Don't be scared.

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:44.890
Come on.

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:03.240
I need to name you...

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:05.700
Toto!

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:08.280
Like that?

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:12.250
It's unanimous!
Your name is Toto starting today!

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:30.100
It's become quite attached to you.

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:31.390
Oh, you're back.

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:33.350
You picked it up?

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:37.270
I could keep him, right?

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:42.820
Yeah, of course.

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:45.610
Hear that, Toto?

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:59.170
Toto, don't move, all right? Ouch!

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:04.130
Let me do it.

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:09.100
What are you trying to make?

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:12.140
A badge of him.

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:19.900
Okay.

00:09:25.070 --> 00:09:25.900
It's done.

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:27.780
Thanks, In.

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:33.410
That should do it.

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:45.920
It's a present.

00:09:46.470 --> 00:09:47.510
In exchange,

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:49.140
I'll take this.

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:13.950
So, Mr. Shuin's the one
who made these badges.

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:18.370
Then they're very precious.

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:23.250
Yeah. That's pretty much all he left me.

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:28.220
So, what happened to Toto after that?

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:12.260
Toto!

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:16.810
Come on, Toto.

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:22.850
Jeez, you're such a scaredy-cat.

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:44.460
Hey, quit that!

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:47.550
Stop, Toto!

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:11.570
Nice catch!

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:16.700
Toto?

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:24.170
Oh no, Toto!

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:27.290
Hold on, I'll save you!

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:28.670
Oh, no!

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:33.590
Hey! Someone! In! Help!

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:11.590
Somebody help!

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:14.760
Someone help!

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:19.430
Somebody! Is anyone out there?

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:20.760
Damn it!

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:25.810
Thank God! This thing isn't coming off.

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:31.860
Sorry to trouble you. Do you have a tool?

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:33.820
How did that happen?

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:37.530
I stepped on it
while I was walking around.

00:13:37.610 --> 00:13:40.700
I don't know who set it up, but it got me.

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:43.040
-You did it yourself, didn't you?
-What?

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:51.210
The creatures of Magmell
will never fall for that kind of trap.

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:53.710
I suspect you're just
trying to make money.

00:13:58.010 --> 00:14:00.010
Hey! Don't touch my stuff.

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:03.350
Hey! Are you listening to me?

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:08.600
Idiot! That's 500,000 esc!

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:14.650
What the hell are you doing?

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:19.110
You should've just listened to me.

00:14:19.490 --> 00:14:21.740
Now, hurry up and take this off.

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:24.740
Hey! You listening to me, you bastard?

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:28.120
If you shoot me,
I won't be able to help you.

00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:30.420
Shut up! Just do it!

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:32.920
You're getting things mixed up.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:36.550
I really don't like you, but I'm still
willing to save you, you know?

00:14:36.630 --> 00:14:38.130
Hurry up!

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:39.260
Good grief.

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:43.220
Hold on a second.

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:47.640
What's... up with him?

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:49.310
Toto?

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:30.440
And...

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:33.440
What happened after that?

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:38.990
I killed it.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:49.700
And...

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:52.370
What happened after that?

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:56.090
I killed it.

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:19.900
But... But why?

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:27.580
Toto!

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:42.170
In?

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:44.050
Did it drink blood?

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:48.010
When it drinks human blood, it transforms.

00:16:48.100 --> 00:16:48.930
What?

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:53.560
Toto's that kind of monster.

00:16:56.900 --> 00:16:58.860
Can we change him back?

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:00.400
-No.
-What?

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:02.240
Remember this, Yo.

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:05.950
This is Magmell.

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:21.840
Wait!

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:23.840
Let me do it!

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:25.130
Can you do it?

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:26.260
Yeah.

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:30.970
In!

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:49.410
Damn it!

00:17:58.080 --> 00:18:00.750
<i>It's okay. Don't be scared.</i>

00:18:46.510 --> 00:18:47.340
Toto!

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:22.210
Well done.

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:24.670
You don't have to remind me...

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:27.250
that this is Magmell, In.

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:37.350
Yo, it's not your fault.

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:50.610
In!

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:14.430
That was the first monster I defeated.

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:20.060
Kill or be killed.
That's how it is in Magmell.

00:20:21.020 --> 00:20:22.020
Sir...

00:20:22.940 --> 00:20:24.020
Sorry, Zero.

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:27.440
I just need a little more time
before you get a pet.

00:20:28.770 --> 00:20:31.110
I'll get over it eventually.

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:32.740
Sir...

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:37.240
It's a client.

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:39.240
Should I turn them away?

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:41.120
No, let them in.

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:42.710
-But--
-It's okay.

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:55.220
Luka's gone missing.

00:21:07.190 --> 00:21:08.060
Sir.

00:21:09.190 --> 00:21:10.230
Don't worry.

00:21:11.940 --> 00:21:14.610
We'll find Luka.

00:21:15.570 --> 00:21:16.530
Really?

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:19.620
Yeah. So let's get moving.

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:22.790
Where can your cat be hiding?

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:25.000
-Luka's a dog.
-What?

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:27.080
Luka's a dog.

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:29.170
Oh, sorry about that.

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:32.000
That's right, sir!

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:33.800
That's definitely a picture of a dog!

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:12.440
PREVIEW

00:23:12.520 --> 00:23:13.900
<i>The Octagon of Evil.</i>

00:23:14.730 --> 00:23:17.150
<i>The crash that occurred in the same ward</i>

00:23:17.230 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>involving both a fighter</i>
<i>and an armed helicopter</i>

00:23:21.280 --> 00:23:24.660
<i>was reported to have been due</i>
<i>to some type of ground attack.</i>

00:23:25.240 --> 00:23:28.370
<i>But in both cases,</i>
<i>the aircraft were nowhere to be found.</i>

00:23:28.870 --> 00:23:30.370
<i>Details on the day of the incident...</i>

00:23:31.250 --> 00:23:32.880
<i>are still unknown.</i>

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:38.300
<i>Next time, "ERIN." Don't miss it.</i>

00:23:38.380 --> 00:23:39.300
ERIN

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:41.880
Subtitle translation by Sachiko Takahashi
